-- title:
--   The main-density product of a duplicated lower-order bundle
-- statement:
--   For any hypergraph bundle $B$, selected vertex set $g_0$, and real base-density function $p$, the main-density product of the lower-order bundle duplicated outside $g_0$ equals the strict-boundary main product times the product of squared densities over edges $g$ with $|g|<|g_0|$ and $g\nsubseteq g_0$.
